      56.13,
      398.17,
      547.23,
      481.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, A. Ibathul RauffHakeem, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the University GrantsCommission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1567/23 ofSeptember 19, 2008 (as last amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2079/10 of July 09, 2018)which specifies the Faculties and Departments of the University of Ruhuna, Sri Lanka, by the substitution for the entry \u201c3.Department of Marketing\u201d appearing in Column II thereof which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Management andFinance\u201d appearing in Column I thereof of the entry \u201c3. Department of Marketing\u201d.",
